{"id":"vod_hh_114336","vodId":"114336","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"人鱼的旋律 第一季","name_cn":"人鱼的旋律 第一季","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第52集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/f51909883261e6203411665223211cba.jpg"},"summary":"露西亚，来自北太平洋的美人鱼公主，登陆寻找她七年前由海中拯救的男孩，当时这位男孩溺水了，她用粉红色的真珠救了他一命，并且把她最珍贵的粉红色珍珠交给那位男孩。七年后她为了继承一事来到了陆地去寻找以前的男孩要回真珠，最终找到了那个男孩，名叫堂本海斗，但是化身成人形的露西亚，名叫七海露西亚的女孩，与她的人鱼型态并不相似；她也不能告诉海斗她真正的身份，否则她将变成泡沫。因此她努力的让海斗去想出她的真正身份。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-11-29 11:42:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":52,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e1w1pQRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dL961nwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dBBoXQXd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dR6YKMOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dR6YKwqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e738yOje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e9r6ALZa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bW6OKjva/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/dL961PXe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e31RrKxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bkRQjwNa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZR0GOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2qx9Xa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bmZR0Mrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/e738ynye/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/av2qxDma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/bkRQjwEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/egJYD73d/index.m